Allahumma Laan Qatalata Fatema Zahra (s.a)<br>
<br>
Lanat Bar Dushmane Nabi, Lanat Bar Dushmane Ali, Lanat Bar Dushmane Zahra!<br>
<br>
Ya Sayyeda ...4<br>
<br>
Laanat Bar Dushmane Zehra<br>
<br>
1. Ay Ahle aza aao suno ghum ka ye qissa,<br>
Jis beti ko keh-te the Nabi Umme Abiha<br>
Ummat ne usse bad-e-Nabi khoob rulaya<br>
Darbar me makhdooma e alam ko bulaya<br>
Aaj talak roti hai duniya, haan badi mazloom he Zahra<br>
Laanat..... 4<br>
<br>
2. Kya ajr e risalat ye Muhammad (s) ko mila he<br>
Us ghar ko jala dala, jahan deen pala he<br>
Shehzadi pe jalta huwa darwaza gira he<br>
Ay momino sar peeto ye gham sab se bada he<br>
Ghurbat e Haidar ka khulaasa, haan badi mazloom he Zahra<br>
Laanat..... 4<br>
 <br>
3. Socho toh Musalmano sitam aysa huwa kyun<br>
Shehzadi ko darbaar me bulwaya gaya kyun<br>
Siddiqa e konain ko jhutlaya gaya kyun<br>
"Mai jhoot nahi bolti" ye kehna para kyun<br>
Dil ye tumhara bhi kahe ga, haan badi mazloom he Zahra<br>
Laanat..... 4<br>
<br>
Laanat Be Dushmane Ali...4<br>
<br>
4. Tareekh me mil ta he qayamat ka ye manzar<br>
Jab ghusl o kafan dene lage Zahra ko Haidar<br>
Jis waqt nazar aya unhe pehlu shikasta<br>
Ek cheekh uthi zor se rone lage Maula,<br>
Nauha he ye sher e khuda ka, haan badi mazloom he Zahra<br>
Laanat..... 4<br>
<br>
Be Fatemata...4<br>
 <br>
5. Is gham ke tasawwur se laraz-ta he mera dil<br>
Jo log muslaman the sab ho gaye baatil<br>
Naam unke tabarre me kiya kar ta hun shamil<br>
Mohsin ke bhi qatil hein woh, Zahra ke bhi qatil<br>
Hashr talak me toh kahunga, haan badi mazloom he Zahra<br>
Laanat..... 4<br>
<br>
6. Baad e paighambar e Islam raha kuch bhi nahi<br>
Us ki taqdeer me matam ke siwa kuch bhi nahi<br>
Ma siwa dard ke, daman me raha kuch bhi nahi<br>
Haye kyun binte Nabi, ye sitam seh ti rahi<br>
Jab ke darwaza gira, keel baazu me chubhi<br>
Silsila barh ta gaya, bass gayi Karbobala<br>
Chal gayi Shah pe churi, aa gayi sham e jafa<br>
Laanat..... 4<br>
<br>
7. Ek roz me Zahra ka bhara ghar huwa barbaad<br>
Mardon me faqat zinda bache Baqar o Sajjad<br>
Sab qaidi bane Shaam chale, maai’le faryaad<br>
Darbar me zalim ke gayi Zainab e nashaad<br>
Kehti rahi saaniye Zahra, haan badi mazloom he Zahra<br>
Laanat..... 4<br>
<br>
8. Mismaar baqayyah me huwa marqad e Zahra<br>
Is gham me likha Mazhar o Mesum ne ye Nauha<br>
Ab baarwey Sarkaar banayenge woh roza<br>
Phir hoga wahan dushman e Zahra pe tabarra<br>
Goonje faza'on me ye nauha, haan badi mazloom he Zahra<br>
Laanat..... 4<br>
<br>
Qatilaan e Zahra pe laanat, laanat<br>
Shimr o Hurmala pe laanat, laanat<br>
Dushman e aza par laanat, laanat<br>
Dushman e wila par laanat, laanat<br>
Laanat bar Hinda jigar-khwaar Beshumaar...Beshumaar<br>
Lanat bar Muljim e bad-kaar Beshumaar...Beshumaar<br>
Lanat bar Yazeed e mai-khwaar Beshumaar...Beshumaar<br>
Lanat bar dushman e Mukhtaar Beshumaar...Beshumaar